[{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0186","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0186.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0463","title":"PerlCal 目录遍历漏洞","description":"PerlCal 2.x 的 cal_make.pl 脚本存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向 p0 参数传入 `../` 等路径遍历序列，绕过路径限制读取服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞影响 PerlCal 2.x 版本，攻击复杂度低，可导致敏感信息泄露（如配置文件、系统文件等）。目前已有公开 PoC 利用代码。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0463"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-06-27T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:21Z","remediation":"PerlCal 已停止维护，无官方补丁。建议立即替换为其他仍在维护的 CGI 日历程序（如 WebCalendar）。如无法替换，可手动修改 cal_make.pl，在 p0 参数处理前添加路径过滤：移除 `../` 及空字节编码，仅允许字母数字文件名。同时在 Web 服务器（Apache/Nginx）配置中增加重写规则，拦截包含 `..` 的请求 URI。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-04/0506.html","http://www.perlcal.com/calendar/docs/bugs.txt","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2663","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6480","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20808","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0463.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0463","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0463.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f0111a41156462d46f484c055bdeafa69cf38c8e/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0463.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-rp73-w495-gq25/GHSA-rp73-w495-gq25.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/sid-msg.map","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/P/perl_cal.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151000_151100.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0463.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0186.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0185","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0185.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0462","title":"Perl Web Server 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Perl Web Server 0.3 及更早版本存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过在 URL 中添加 `..`（点点）序列绕过路径限制，读取服务器上任意文件。该漏洞源于程序未对用户请求中的路径进行充分过滤和规范化处理，攻击者只需向目标服务器发送特制的 HTTP 请求即可利用，可导致敏感信息泄露（如配置文件、密码文件等）。CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0462"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-06-27T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:21Z","remediation":"建议立即停止使用 Perl Web Server 0.3 及更早版本，迁移至受支持的 Web 服务器（如 Apache httpd 或 Nginx）。在迁移完成前，可在反向代理或 WAF 层面拦截包含 `../` 路径遍历序列的 HTTP 请求，同时对用户输入的 URL 进行规范化处理，移除所有相对路径引用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-04/0426.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2648","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6451","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20797","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0462.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0462","https://github.com/CPAN-Security/cpan-advisory-database/blob/bc9ed2336eeed09f48acb0a64fd37970dc5a31d6/triage/CVE-2001-0462.yml","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0462.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f0111a41156462d46f484c055bdeafa69cf38c8e/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0462.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-x5pq-xmx6-4vvj/GHSA-x5pq-xmx6-4vvj.json","https://github.com/briandfoy/cpan-security-advisory/blob/2089ff7201b44e5e462742a5baaa080ba003d257/TO_DO","https://github.com/yingdongucas/inconsistency_detection/blob/ae69c4fdb796e9540716e0fbf8686c5c8d29a42b/dataset/re_data/dirtra_full_dup.txt","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151000_151100.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0185.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0184","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0184.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0461","title":"FOLDOC Free Online Dictionary of Computing 1.0 命令注入漏洞","description":"Free Online Dictionary of Computing（FOLDOC）1.0 的 template.cgi 脚本存在命令注入漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 template.cgi 参数传递 shell 元字符（如反引号、管道符等）实现任意文件读取和命令执行。攻击无需身份认证，利用难度低，可导致敏感信息泄露及服务器被完全控制。该漏洞影响 FOLDOC 1.0 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。目前已有公开的 ExploitDB 利用代码。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0461"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-06-27T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:21Z","remediation":"立即删除或禁用 FOLDOC 中的 template.cgi 脚本，或限制其仅允许本地访问。如必须使用，在 CGI 脚本中对用户输入进行严格过滤，使用 escapeshellarg() 或类似函数转义 shell 元字符（如 `;` `|` `&` `$` `` ` ``），并配置 Web 服务器（如 Apache）通过 mod_rewrite 拒绝包含特殊字符的请求。由于该软件已停止维护，建议迁移至替代方案。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-03/0109.html","http://wombat.doc.ic.ac.uk/foldoc/index.html","http://www.osvdb.org/5591","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6217","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20686","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cve