on":"该产品（Baltimore Technologies WEBsweeper 4.0）已停止维护，无官方补丁。建议在 WEBsweeper 配置中限制 HTTP 请求头最大长度（如将 Referer 头限制在 8KB 以内），或在 WEBsweeper 前端部署反向代理/WAF 拦截超长请求头（如 nginx 的 large_client_header_buffers 设置为 8k），并尽快迁移至受支持的 Web 安全网关产品。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/167406","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6214","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20681","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0460.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0460","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0460.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f0111a41156462d46f484c055bdeafa69cf38c8e/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0460.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-g844-hmxx-5gwm/GHSA-g844-hmxx-5gwm.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88822/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0460.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--23109f63-0914-4e60-92cb-1c74fdda5b50.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/f16f8a77389e4bc58a66c9547351335940b7ddb9/2001.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0183.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0183.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0183.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0182","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0182.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0459","title":"Rob Malda ASCDC 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"ascdc 是 AfterStep 窗口管理器中的 CD 播放器控制工具，其以 setuid 权限运行时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可通过向 -d、-m 或 -f 选项传递超长字符串参数触发缓冲区溢出，导致攻击者以 root 权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 AfterStep 及包含 ascdc 组件的相关 Linux 发行版，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。利用该漏洞需要本地系统访问权限，但无需用户交互，攻击复杂度低。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0459"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-06-27T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:20Z","remediation":"升级 AfterStep 至 1.8.1 及以上版本，该版本修复了 ascdc 的缓冲区溢出问题。如无法升级，立即移除 ascdc 的 setuid 权限（chmod u-s /usr/bin/ascdc），防止本地用户通过 -d、-m、-f 参数触发缓冲区溢出获取 root 权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98408897106411&w=2","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6204","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20679","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0459.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0459","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0459.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f0111a41156462d46f484c055bdeafa69cf38c8e/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0459.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-whv9-37w9-wj7x/GHSA-whv9-37w9-wj7x.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x84000/83025/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0459.json","h