护，建议迁移至受支持的邮件服务器（如 Postfix、Dovecot），并在网络边界防火墙限制对 POP3 端口（110/TCP）的访问，仅允许可信 IP 连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-04/0378.html","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/179217","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/6444.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2641","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20792","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0442.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0442","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0442.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f2c577e1255b2c3fd617b7f1c499a222feb7b668/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0442.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vwf5-w456-qjfw/GHSA-vwf5-w456-qjfw.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151000_151100.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--e2e48a8c-cf35-47c2-83f1-a500ce86d847.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0442.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/7e9d0f9f6e96f881defceb153c169913a330643d/2001.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0179.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0175","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0175.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0425","title":"Adcycle AdLibrary.pm SQL注入漏洞","description":"AdCycle 0.78b 的 AdLibrary.pm 模块存在 SQL 注入漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标系统发送特制的 HTTP 请求，在 Agent 请求头中插入恶意 SQL 语句，该语句被拼接至用于验证登录信息的 SQL 查询中，从而导致攻击者绕过认证获取管理员权限。该漏洞影响 AdCycle 0.77 及 0.78b 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。Exploit-DB 已公开利用代码，建议用户升级至最新版本或对用户输入进行严格过滤。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0425"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-06-27T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:17Z","remediation":"升级 AdCycle 至官方最新版本（若已停止维护则建议迁移至其他广告管理系统）。如无法升级，修改 AdLibrary.pm 中对 User-Agent 头部的处理逻辑，使用参数化查询（prepared statement）替代字符串拼接构造 SQL 语句，并对所有用户输入（包括 HTTP 头部字段）进行严格的特殊字符过滤。临时缓解措施可在 Web 服务器（如 Apache）层面限制 adcenter.cgi 的访问来源 IP，或部署 WAF 规则拦截包含 SQL 注入特征的 User-Agent 请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/163942","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2393","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20642","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/377bb49f7479dd297ab5004f75a37c291a136578/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0425.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0425","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0425.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f2c577e1255b2c3fd617b7f1c499a222feb7b668/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0425.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/db909d46c3d9b98ec1f95daa3c88d7a8990ea8f5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7hqf-49cq-v3f3/GHSA-7hqf-49cq-v3f3.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151000_151100.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0425.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204c