s_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0147.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0146","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0146.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0333","title":"Microsoft IIS CGI 文件名双解码远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft IIS 5.0 及更早版本存在 CGI 文件名双解码目录遍历漏洞。攻击者将 \"..\" 和 \"\\\" 等路径遍历字符进行双重 URL 编码发送给目标服务器，可绕过安全检查实现目录跳转并以 IUSR_machinename 账户权限执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 IIS 5.0 及更早版本，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。Microsoft 已在 MS01-026 安全公告中发布修复补丁。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0333"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-06-27T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:07Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2001 年 6 月安全公告 MS01-026 提供的补丁（可通过 Windows Update 获取），该补丁修复了 IIS 对 CGI 文件名的二次解码缺陷。如无法安装补丁，可在 IIS 管理器中删除不必要的脚本映射（如 .ida、.idq、.printer 等），并限制匿名用户对可执行目录的写入权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98992056521300&w=2","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2001-12.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2708","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2001/ms01-026","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6534","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A1018","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A1051","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A37","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A78","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/16467","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/5c4b2ba2a59a96457ab4b8ea4ee82efc5782bb1d/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0333.json","https://github.com/hackingyseguridad/directoriotraversal/blob/3063847ce7d77cf23fb34ea227288234eff6ce77/CVE-2001-0333.sh","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0333","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2001/CVE-2001-0333.rules","https://github.com/OWASP/www-community/blob/48c19419299fe6b2270a96dfd1ec2b3fb77fa165/pages/Double_Encoding.md","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/pinchbench/skill/blob/819384ae830492365b8363fc26bc2602e73f216d/tasks/task_log_apache_critical.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0333.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/475f53ac063af305fc146a443cce993188109d56/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0333.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-j59q-fjq9-v929/GHSA-j59q-fjq9-v929.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0146.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0145","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0145.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0329","title":"Mozilla Bugzilla 任意命令执行漏洞","description":"Mozilla Bugzilla 2.4至2.10版本存在任意命令执行漏洞。远程攻击者可在用户名参数中注入shell元字符，通过post_bug.cgi的Bugzilla_login cookie或process_bug.cgi的who参数触发该漏洞，导致目标服务器执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响Bugzilla 2.4/2.6/2.8/2.10等多个版本，CVSS评分7.5，危害等级高。建议升级至修复版本或对用户输入进行严格过滤。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0329"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-06-27T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:06Z","remediation":"立即升级至 Bugzilla 2.12 或更高版本，该版本已将 system() 调用改为多参数形式以避免 shell 元字符注入。如无法升级，需手动修补 process_bug.cgi、post_bug.cgi、createattachment.cgi 和 backdoor.cgi，将形如 system(\"./processmail $who\") 的调用改为 system(\"./processmail\", $who) 的多参数形式；同时在 CGI.pl 中对 who 参数增加 DBname_to_id 合法性校验。此外将 MySQL 以非 root 用户运行，设置 CGI 脚本和数据目录权限为 0700，避免 umask 0 的宽松权限设置。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.atstake.com/research/advisories/2001/a043001-1.txt","http://www.mozilla.org/projects/bugzilla/security2_12.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1199","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19909","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/5c4b2ba2a59a96457ab4b8ea4ee82efc5782bb1d/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0329.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0329","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0329.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/475f53ac063af305fc146a443cce993188109d56/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0329.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xh8x-v85v-9297/GHSA-xh8x-v85v-9297.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/bugzilla_remote_exec.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0329.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--cc6e8b06-b749-4a17-af73-a7be1505e98c.json","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/bugzilla_remote_exec.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0145.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0145.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0145.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0152","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0152.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0369","title":"DG/UX lpsched 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"DG/UX 4.20 的 lpsched（行式打印机调度守护进程）在处理超长错误消息时存在本地缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可通过向 lpsched 提交特制的长错误消息触发缓冲区溢出，导致系统崩溃或执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 DG/UX 4.20 版本，攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限才能利用，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0369"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-06-27T00:00:00Z","updated":"2001-06-27T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 DG/UX 至厂商修复版本（如存在），或限制 lpsched 本地访问权限，仅允许受信用户执行 lp 相关命令。由于 DG/UX 已停止技术支持且无安全更新，建议迁移至受支持的 Unix/Linux 系统以彻底修复此缓冲区溢出漏洞。临时缓解措施：通过 chmod 700 限制 lpsched 可执行权限并启用系统审计日志监控异常错误消息。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20697","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/34b929f9979d6d9d9584dfab31f29f50dcf08e3f/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0369.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0369","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0369.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4591185d8ea1fe47b6e30df3286bd52753a931ce/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0369.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-c947-r3rw-whg9/GHSA-c947-r3rw-whg9.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x84000/83015/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0369.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--ad774241-966f-4d0d-9843-c73474e18ecd.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/a3d797a054f33a26fc99648a4e1cc47b2bce8d08/2001.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc"